InterSystems Joins IBM PartnerWorld Healthcare, Life Sciences
Industry Networks


Cambridge, Mass.=97September 2, 2004=97InterSystems Corporation today =
announced its participation in IBM PartnerWorld Industry Networks for =
ISVs in the Healthcare/Life Sciences market. The agreement supports and =
strengthens joint marketing initiatives by both firms on a global scale. =


InterSystems, the leading database provider in the healthcare sector, =
delivers high performance software products targeted for IT =
organizations and independent software vendors. InterSystems=92 CACH=C9 =
post-relational database and the Ensemble universal integration platform =
enable the rapid creation and fast integration of high performance =
applications.=20


"This agreement enhances our corporate commitment to healthcare," says =
InterSystems Vice President of Strategic Planning Paul Grabscheid. =
"Working with IBM helps us deliver optimal technology solutions in the =
healthcare sector worldwide."

"The Healthcare and Life Sciences sector comprises one of the largest =
sets of interconnected markets in the world and presents a huge =
opportunity for ISVs to capture new revenue worldwide," says Buell =
Duncan, general manager, ISV & Developer Relations, IBM. "Working =
together with IBM, InterSystems can capitalize on the wide range of =
benefits available through the PartnerWorld Healthcare/Life Sciences =
