http://fcron.free.fr

or get it from metalab at :

ftp://metalab.unc.edu/pub/Linux/system/daemons/cron/fcron-2.9.5.src.tar.gz
(388kB)

(I've sent the file but it may take some time before it is available on
metalab)

or get it from seul.org (USA) :

ftp://ftp.seul.org/pub/fcron/fcron-2.9.5.src.tar.gz (388kB)

I hope you will enjoy it,

Thibault.

